        "rationale": "Provides a complete step-by-step worked numerical problem with given values (4 g H2), balanced reaction, intermediate molar mass and mole calculations, mole ratio conversion, and final answer (36 g H2O).",
        "review_flags": [],
        "contextualization": {
          "value": "none",
          "evidence": []
        },
        "passages": [
          {
            "id": "p37",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "heading"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "### رابعاً: مثال عملي نطبقه سوياً",
            "start": 2323,
            "end": 2356
          },
          {
            "id": "p38",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "**المسألة:** ",
            "start": 2358,
            "end": 2371
          },
          {
            "id": "p39",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "احسب كتلة الماء ($H_2O$) الناتجة عن احتراق **4 جرام** من غاز الهيدروجين ($H_2$) تماماً مع كمية كافية من الأكسجين، حسب المعادلة:",
            "start": 2372,
            "end": 2499
          },
          {
            "id": "p40",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "$$2H_2 + O_2 \\rightarrow 2H_2O$$",
            "start": 2500,
            "end": 2532
          },
          {
            "id": "p41",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "*(علماً بأن الكتل الذرية: $H = 1 \\text{ g/mol}$ ، $O = 16 \\text{ g/mol}$)*",
            "start": 2533,
            "end": 2607
          },
          {
            "id": "p42",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "separator"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "---",
            "start": 2609,
            "end": 2612
          },
          {
            "id": "p43",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "**الحل بالخطوات الثلاث:**",
            "start": 2614,
            "end": 2639
          },
          {
            "id": "p44",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **تجهيز سريع للكتل المولية:**",
            "start": 2641,
            "end": 2672
          },
          {
            "id": "p45",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * الكتلة المولية لـ $H_2 = 2 \\times 1 = 2 \\text{ g/mol}$",
            "start": 2673,
            "end": 2731
          },
          {
            "id": "p46",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  * الكتلة المولية لـ $H_2O = (2 \\times 1) + 16 = 18 \\text{ g/mol}$",
            "start": 2732,
            "end": 2799
          },
          {
            "id": "p47",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **الخطوة (1): نحول جرامات $H_2$ إلى مولات:**",
            "start": 2801,
            "end": 2847
          },
          {
            "id": "p48",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  $$\\text{عدد مولات } H_2 = \\frac{\\text{الكتلة}}{\\text{الكتلة المولية}} = \\frac{4}{2} = 2 \\text{ mol}$$",
            "start": 2848,
            "end": 2951
          },
          {
            "id": "p49",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **الخطوة (2): نستخدم المعادلة لمعرفة مولات $H_2O$ (ضرب تبادلي / مقص):**",
